<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cutter &amp; Buck as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cutter &amp; Buck as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Ladenburg Thalmann said analyst Joseph Teklits initiated coverage of Cutter &amp; Buck Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- shares rose 3/8 to 12 in late morning exchange trading.</p>
